# 04 Freelance Marketplace

## Overview

Develop a platform that connects clients with freelancers for jobs and services.

## Core Features

* User registration
* Freelancer profiles
* Client profiles
* Job posting
* Job search
* Proposals
* Messaging
* Reviews and ratings
* Project management

## Possible Extensions

* Skill-based freelancer recommendations
* AI job matching
* Automated proposal analysis
* Skill verification
* Freelance performance analytics

## Suggested Difficulty

Advanced
